# AI Job Impact Analysis – Task 2 (EDA)

## CodeAlpha Data Analytics Internship

### Project objective

This project performs Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA) on the AI Job Impact dataset to understand the impact of AI adoption on employee salaries, automation risk, productivity, and job satisfaction.

### Tools used

* Python
* Google Colab
* Pandas
* NumPy
* Matplotlib
* Seaborn

### Analysis performed

* Data loading
* Data inspection
* Missing value analysis
* Duplicate removal
* Data cleaning
* Feature engineering
* Statistical summary
* Exploratory Data Analysis

### Output

* Cleaned dataset
* EDA notebook
* Summary statistics
* Insights for further visualization
